# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the RB pack (the parked-engine rebind's slow mode; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the integrated branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Templates only: no tag is pushed by their author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the READ.
# ONE IMAGE: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-rebind-fast-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds (sed -i 's/tp4-rebind-fast-1/<tag>/' *.env). The -fx-twa profiles are generated by
# make_fusion_profiles.py --write from scripts/ci/fusion-wp/RB.json on the integrated branch (WP0); until then c2_serving_job.py refuses the lever templates.
# RBC1 (TIMED, CONTROL (A), first of the ABAB): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic. Eight coding agents of eight turns (agent-turns-prefix: every turn a returning session rebound onto its
# parked engine) then the hit-mid-cold arrival (levern-hit). TIMED: no audits, no digests. READ: python3 scripts/ci/rebind_split.py <container log> per arm:
# the slow count (B >= 400 ms) and the per-group medians; then the turn latencies p50/p90 PAIRED (RBC1, RBL1) and (RBC2, RBL2), the transcripts equal.
# Duration (estimate): 55 minutes (an agent-turns arm took 16.5 minutes, v580).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-rebind-fast-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=agent-turns-prefix,levern-hit
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_PREFIX_AGENTS=8
C2_BOX_MINUTES=55
